    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-179" contextRef="c-10">&lt;p&gt;On January 26, 2026, the Respondent entered into a Purchase and Sale Agreement with Eiger Operating Company to sell the WTG Hugoton Pipeline for an estimated sales price of $2 million. The sale closed on April 30, 2026, with an effective date of January 1, 2026. As of June 30, 2026, the transfer of the WTG Hugoton Pipeline to Eiger Operating Company remained subject to final approval by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC), which was still pending as of that date.&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
